74034f28e814341c7a85a3a3284399ddcd3ca04e078e1024d154c169","url":"https://tibiopedia.pl/npcs/a_Skull"}],"wiki_facts":{"br_coordinate_frame":"Tibia_reference_world_coordinates_not_Oteryn_placement","br_coordinates":[[33164,32492,11]],"br_trade_reference":{"BuyFromPlayer":{},"SellToPlayer":{}},"city":"Darashia","description":"Spotkamy podczas wykonywania An Ancient Feud Quest .","location_description":"jaskinie Werehyaena","npc_lines":["*A horned skull rests on a stone pile here. Underneath the jaw bone, there are faint grinding marks on the rock, as if the skull was moved frequently.*","Greetings, traveller!","I forgot my own name a long time ago.","I consider myself a storyteller. So, if you are interested in a little story ... I also know a thing or two about the cards.","I thought so! Well, listen: The confused maiden shall defeat the forsaken wizard when the days grow long in the age of fate.","I thought so! Well, listen: The cold-hearted viper will not roam with the honest lion at the coming of death.","I know about eleven cards. ...","The Foremother, the Artist, the Gambler, the Fountain, the Ship of Emeralds, the Princess, the Heroic Monk, the Prophet, the Orphan, the Forgotten Minstrel and the Queen of Machines.","This card depicts an old woman with a scar on her face and a basket of fruit on a hill. It is associated with protection, compassion and a journey. Inverted, it represents deception and loss.","This card depicts a middle-aged woman with brushes and an owl while the sun sets. It is associated with creativity and prosperity. Inverted, it represents a breakdown or a devastating announcement.","This card depicts a middle-aged man with golden hair and an oak tree inside a walled city. It is associated with renewal and transformation. Inverted, it represents treason and death.","This card depicts an old man, sitting at a fountain. It is associated with reunion, truth and joy. Inverted, it represents tyranny and violence.","This card depicts a ship with a cargo of emeralds. It is associated with wealth and joy. Inverted, it represents financial difficulty and miscommunication.","This card depicts a young woman with copper-colored eyes, wearing a crown. It is associated with romance, opportunity and generosity. Inverted, it represents illusion and death.","This card depicts a young boy and a spider. It is associated with a heroic deed, nobility and strength. Inverted, it represents disappointment and exile.","This card depicts an old woman and a gryphon. It is associated with wisdom and prophecy. Inverted, it represents disease and a reversal of fortune.","This card depicts a small girl involved in a parting of ways. It is associated with forgiveness and kindness. Inverted, it represents surrender and disagreement.","This card depicts a tall young man with hazel eyes, holding a lute and a hawk. It is associated with willpower and royalty. Inverted, it represents grief and anger.","This card depicts a young woman and a golem near a fortress. It is associated with science, secrets and research. Inverted, it represents ignorance and fear.","The undead of Drefia are working together with the werehyaenas. I overheard a secret conversation between the werehyaena leader and a lich right here!","A fierce and cunning hyaena named Rhargu. She lives in her own cave down here.","Farewell."],"npc_lines_semantics":"source_utterances_without_trigger_or_state_assignment","profession":"nieznany","quest_references":[{"label":"An Ancient Feud Quest","url":"https://tibiopedia.pl/quests/An_Ancient_Feud_Quest"}],"specialty":null,"tp_coordinate_frame":"tibiopedia-map-pixels-floor-unverified","tp_map_markers":[[3340,3565,4]],"tp_trade_available":"nie","tp_trade_reference":{"BuyFromPlayer":{},"SellToPlayer":{}},"voices_text":null}}

