ources":[{"access_method":"retained_public_API_snapshot","revision":367585,"snapshot_sha256":"0773232ddd356be273474be7b3aea645ed5dbbf93e5832a94d565ad9e579657a","source":"TibiaWiki BR","source_sha256":"b0dfcc5865cfd35b768e1eb5c5a23aa30cef5e023a33032802c8e5469a87c790","timestamp":"2022-08-09T22:56:40Z","url":"https://www.tibiawiki.com.br/wiki/Demon_Mother"},{"access_method":"retained_public_HTTP_HTML_capture","captured_at":"2026-10-01T11:22:28.773243+00:00","revision":null,"source":"Tibiopedia","source_byte_length":91393,"source_sha256":"39ebc76b819563e2b8e63695395d7bc9f6ffadb2ec60d762e16e91140e6f127b","url":"https://tibiopedia.pl/npcs/Demon_Mother"}],"wiki_facts":{"br_coordinate_frame":"Tibia_reference_world_coordinates_not_Oteryn_placement","br_coordinates":[[32637,32127,7]],"br_trade_reference":{"BuyFromPlayer":{},"SellToPlayer":{}},"city":"Jakundaf Desert","description":"Pojawia się podczas Demon's Lullaby w maju.","location_description":"Jakundaf Desert","npc_lines":["Oh no. Not again!","Where is this brat again?","You need a serious beating.","I want some days off.","Greetings, meatbag. Speak quick, my patience is short.","I'm the mother of thousands of demons. If you think they are a pain when they are grown up, you haven't met the young ones. And particularly the babies can be bothersome. ...","I desperately need a few days off or I cannot guarantee for anything!","My little darlings are somewhat tiresome sometimes. And there are hundreds of them. Even I need a rest from time to time. Some time for myself. Do you have any idea for how long I didn't have had my horns done? ...","And it's not easy for a single demon mother to meet an evil guy. As soon as they hear you have a few hundred children at home, they teleport into another dimension! ...","Even demon mothers want to relax now and then, have a bath in the lava pits and listen to the screams of some tortured souls. ...","And I am not the kind of mother that let's her little demons watch the torture pits the whole day. I expect from them to do something creative and evil on their own. ...","I won't drop them into some foreign dimension to take care of their own like other demon mothers do. ...","Of course a torn off head will regrow in a few days but I'm old-fashioned and don't like to see my little darlings suffer. ...","This is where you come in! I entrust this world to take care for my little darlings for a while!","Ah, well. My kids sometimes like it rough. To calm them, I usually slap something hard on their head. Hey, don't give me that look, we are demons after all.","I need some of you mortals to care for some of my children. They are only demon babies so it shouldn't be too hard, even for such limited creatures as you are. ...","I'll hand you one of my babies and you'll take care of it. You can only care for one baby at a time. ...","Demon babies are moody and spoilt. Each few hours it will request something from you and you will have to fulfil its wishes to keep it happy. It will let you know what it wants. ...","Do whatever pleases the baby to satisfy it for a few hours. If you comply with its wishes often enough, it will become cheery. It might take a few days and don't think it's easy. ...","Some of the baby's wishes might be exotic and others outright dangerous. But that is the fate of babysitters since the dawn of time. ...","Bring my darlings back to me as soon as they are cheery. This phase will last for a while and it will be easy for me to keep an eye on them. ...","If enough of your people help me and bring me my cheery darlings, I will be pleased and your world will be rewarded. ...","If you fail though .. well, let's say you will not like this alternative. I can become really mean if I am mad and most demons owe me something! ...","So are you up to this?","Uh ... Uhm ... Really? Fabulous! Here we go! Take care! It is now bound to YOU, so don't try to swap it with another baby. My magic will prevent that and return it to you!","You did surprisingly well in handling my little darling. I might have use for your nanny skills another time.","Are you ready to take care of one of my little darlings for a while?","Hey! I already gave you one of my children! If you have failed to take care of it, it will find me. And then I'll find YOU!","Though I feel like tearing you apart, I can't even blame you. Still, if your world fails, I will make you suffer!","Are you here to bring one of my little darlings back to me?","Brilliant! Your world might actually avert my wrath. We will see.","We are creatures of power and knowledge. We are more diverse than you mortals will ever comprehend. The knowledge and wisdom we have gained in our long lives are paling your fleeting vision of what you think is the world.","Do you really think I have time to think about gods? I have hardly time for a spontaneous prayer that Zathroth may give me some spare time! ...","But I guess he is too busy and can't answer those prayers, so I take the matter into my own hands, just like mothers usually do.","I forbid my children to play there. With all those good-doers questing there, they might get hurt.","<Grumbles>"],"npc_lines_semantics":"source_utterances_without_trigger_or_state_assignment","profession":"Demon mother","quest_references":[{"label":"Demon's Lullaby","url":"https://tibiopedia.pl/quests/Demons_Lullaby"}],"specialty":null,"tp_coordinate_frame":"tibiopedia-map-pixels-floor-unverified","tp_map_markers":[[2797,3186,8]],"tp_trade_available":"nie","tp_trade_reference":{"BuyFromPlayer":{},"SellToPlayer":{}},"voices_text":null}}

