96caa7a1ba7954","url":"https://tibiopedia.pl/npcs/Om'Wake_Naha"}],"wiki_facts":{"br_coordinate_frame":"Tibia_reference_world_coordinates_not_Oteryn_placement","br_coordinates":[[33746,31332,7]],"br_trade_reference":{"BuyFromPlayer":{},"SellToPlayer":{}},"city":"Rascacoon","description":"Spotkamy podczas wykonywania A Pirate's Tail Quest .","location_description":"Centrum Rascacoon.","npc_lines":["Hello, traveller! Be welcome!","My name is Om'Wake Naha, which translates into 'has many things' in your language.","I am responsible for supplies and trade of the colony.","Pesky ratmen are constantly raiding our cheese supplies. I could use a helping hand or two, to get rid of this problem.","The pirats use transformation magic to enter my cheese cellar as rats and they devour and steal our precious cheese.","Push as many cheese as you can into the cheese larder in the center of the cellar. Use the staffs that our shaman supplied to dispel the disguise of the rats to fight the intruders.","Our town, Rascacoon, is just a colony. Our ancestors came here from a place far away on a journey to see the all wonders the world has to offer.","We face many hardships and hazards but our people are resourceful and until the pirats showed up our colony was thriving.","After several years of travel and hardships our ancestors settled here.","One day, when our colony is huge and striving, some of the young ones will go on their own journey and after a long travel will build their own colony.","This day is still far away. There is still space enough and so much to be accomplished that no one gets bored.","It's only an old story. Our tribe left that place generations ago."],"npc_lines_semantics":"source_utterances_without_trigger_or_state_assignment","profession":"dostawca","quest_references":[{"label":"A Pirate's Tail Quest","url":"https://tibiopedia.pl/quests/A_Pirates_Tail_Quest"}],"specialty":null,"tp_coordinate_frame":"tibiopedia-map-pixels-floor-unverified","tp_map_markers":[[3921,2