the pieces of an ancient magical helmet of great power. Legend holds that the pharaohs will not part from their treasures easily... even after death.","There are many treasures out there for adventurers like you to claim, child. If you are brave enough to descend into hell itself! ...","There are many tasks around the world for experienced adventurers like you on the journey to the very Pits of Inferno! But beware! You never know what horrors stand between you and your desires.","Do you want to know what horror is, young adventurer? Horror has a name in these lands... actually, seven names. ...","Apocalypse, Ashfalor, Bazir, Infernatil, Pumin, Tafariel and Verminor. The Ruthless Seven, seven archdemons under the command of a god.","Zathroth is the god that controls the Ruthless Seven and he is the God of Destruction, #N. He is the evil half of one of the elder god. The other half is Uman the Wise. ...","Together they are one. Interesting, isn't it? Thought so.","I do not have a proper name, for I am a child of nature. I was given the gift to communicate with ancient ethereal beings; that is where my name comes from: the 'Spirit Speaker'.","The gift that has been bestowed upon me is the ability to communicate with the spirits and other ethereal entities who are among us. ...","It helps me uncover important knowledge about our surroundings. Knowledge I then share with the people who visit this place to inspire them to explore the wonders this world has to offer.","Job? I am a spirit speaker and a traveller of these lands. I discover its mysteries and learn about its past... our past. ...","Now you may be wondering what I do with all that knowledge and the answer is simple - I share it.","Mysteries! This world is full of them; take for instance the mysterious creature who lurks in the jungles of Port Hope which is said to carry one of the rarest plants known to botany! ...","Or the tales of underwater kingdoms ruled by fish-like creatures. Or perhaps the legend surrounding a demonic tree on the Plains of Havoc. ...","Interesting, isn't it? And this is just a taste of what is out there for you to explore.","May the spirits guide you."],"npc_lines_semantics":"source_utterances_without_trigger_or_state_assignment","profession":"szaman","quest_references":[],"specialty":null,"tp_coordinate_frame":"tibiopedia-map-pixels-floor-unverified","tp_map_markers":[[3040,3186,8]],"tp_trade_available":"nie","tp_trade_reference":{"BuyFromPlayer":{},"SellToPlayer":{}},"voices_text":null}}

